@startuml
actor "Специалист\nпо безопасности" as User
participant "DeviceController" as Controller
participant "WiFiScanner" as Scanner
participant "NetworkInterface" as NetInt
participant "AttackExecutor" as Attack
participant "ReportGenerator" as Report

User -> Controller: 1. Запуск режима аудита
activate Controller

Controller -> Scanner: 2. scan_networks()
activate Scanner
Scanner -> NetInt: 3. set_monitor_mode()
NetInt --> Scanner: 4. monitor mode active
Scanner -> NetInt: 5. capture_packets(30)
NetInt --> Scanner: 6. packet data
Scanner --> Controller: 7. список сетей
deactivate Scanner

Controller --> User: 8. отображение сетей

User -> Controller: 9. выбор цели для атаки
Controller -> Attack: 10. deauth_attack(mac, count=50)
activate Attack

Attack -> NetInt: 11. send_deauth_packets()
NetInt --> Attack: 12. packets sent
Attack --> Controller: 13. атака выполнена
deactivate Attack

Controller -> Report: 14. add_event("deauth", details)
activate Report
Report -> Report: 15. запись в лог
Report --> Controller: 16. лог обновлен
deactivate Report

Controller --> User: 17. результат атаки
deactivate Controller
@enduml
